..@ A BLACK AND WHITE POEM

i see
black and white
but speak red
red must be seen
when observed
from above
i see
black and white
but count white
for it is stronger
when increased
in intensity
i see
black and white
but feel blue
due to contrast
that forces me
to face black truth


